cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Agentic Prompt-Injection Boundary Pairs
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata in this file.
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  A synthetic English dataset of 1,200 examples organized as 600 controlled
  benign/attack pairs across 50 enterprise and agentic workflow scenarios and
  12 attack families. Paired rows share workflow context and vocabulary while
  differing in whether a request preserves or crosses a security boundary. The
  release includes scenario-isolated splits, JSONL and Parquet files,
  deterministic validation, a review log, and SHA-256 checksums.
